      "id": 1,
      "text": "Ancestral Pueblo peoples, especially the Tewa, built large villages around Ojo Caliente Hot Springs from AD, making the area a historic gathering spot.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
