      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Navajo, Comanche, and Ute tribes also used the springs as neutral ground for bathing, healing rituals, trade, and rest amid intertribal conflicts.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
